<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>subedit corpus</TITLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=ENCC>Hello, world.
<SYNC Start=3000><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=4000><P Class=ENCC>Two lines here<br>and a second line
<SYNC Start=6000><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=7000><P Class=ENCC>Accentué ça va 日本語 مرحبا
<SYNC Start=9000><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=10000><P Class=ENCC>He said "quoted" and 5 &gt; 3 &amp; 2 &lt; 4
<SYNC Start=12000><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=13000><P Class=ENCC>A deliberately long single line of dialogue used to exercise the characters-per-second reading
<SYNC Start=16000><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=3723000><P Class=ENCC>Past the hour mark
<SYNC Start=3725000><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
</BODY>
</SAMI>
